This package contains adapted HOAI tool declarations and request builders from
BrandGrowthOS/bgos-claude-plugin, commit
3ecbb58679febcc243f671e05788b521b065546e (version 0.38.15), licensed Apache-2.0.

The adapted files live in src/hoai-shared/ (compiled as dist/hoai-shared/).
Changes include typed transport integration, Codex-specific tool naming,
and free-text-only native form fields in ask_user_input.
The upstream Apache-2.0 license is included in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.
Other original codex-channel-bgos code is covered by the root MIT LICENSE.

The browser runtime under vendor/browser-profile/ is copied from
BrandGrowthOS/bgos-claude-plugin under Apache-2.0. Its exact upstream commit
and every source file SHA256 are recorded in vendor/browser-profile/source.json.
The runtime is unchanged; Codex-specific process ownership and configuration
live outside that vendored directory. The same Apache-2.0 license above applies.
